<SCRIPT LANGUAGE="JavaScript">

<!--//

   if (document.images) {

      // Load images needed [BACK] button.

      back_on  = new Image(); back_on.src  = "../../buttons/back_on.gif";  
      back_off = new Image(); back_off.src = "../../buttons/back.gif";  
   }

   function TurnOn() {

      // Displays image and updates status bar.

      if (document.images) {
         document["back"].src = back_on.src;
         window.status = 'Go back to previous page';
      }
   }

   function TurnOff() {

      // Displays image and clears status bar.

      if (document.images) {
         document["back"].src = back_off.src;
         window.status = '';
      }
   }

//-->

</SCRIPT>

<H3><CENTER><FONT COLOR="#ffff00"><A HREF="mailto:Inspec71@aol.com">Alex Wakefield</A></FONT></CENTER></H3>

Alex's new car is a 1995 M reg 3 door car, in Racing Red.  The car had done 
67,000 miles when he bought it from a dealer in Bexhill, and with a full 
service history, should last a lot longer (fingers crossed!).  The car is 
very straight and original and is very unusual in that it is full 1995 model 
year specification, with rear headrests, airbag and seatbelt pretensioners.   
Also, the car has ABS and drivers seat height adjust. 
<P>
This car will most likely stay in its original state, although it will need a 
few things sorting out, starting with fitting new front foglamps and seeing 
to a couple of other detail points.  Spit & Polish owe Alex a free 
recondition of his wheels so thats also on the cards for very soon, they 
should finish the car off perfectly. 

